// Vanilla JS, no build step (same pattern as the rest of mapy-analizy).
// i18n dict is local to this page but shares the site-wide `mapyAnalizyLang`
// key so the EN/PL toggle stays in sync with the catalog. Charts are hand-built
// inline SVG fed from report_data.json (generated by
// easy-R5/tools/realtime_delay_cities/export_report_data.py).

